<title>FRANCE: Morocco millers again postpone wheat tender - trade.</title>
<headline>Morocco millers again postpone wheat tender - trade.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moroccan millers have again postponed a tender for the import of 20,000 tonnes of optional soft wheat for delivery between November 20 and November 30, European grain traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>The Moroccan Millers Association had already postponed the tender to October 31 from an initial date of October 28.</p>
<p>Traders said they expected millers to re-tender for the wheat later this week.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
